<lb n="26"/>was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">form</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> jedes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ort</unclear> dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> hilfflichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bysprung</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>thuon, und man sich der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pässen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versicheren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welle</unclear>, damit man
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> mehr ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">endtlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear>, und sich uff den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begëbenden</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notfahl</unclear> (den der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allmechtig</unclear> von uns mit gnaden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wënden</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>welle) daruff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">trostlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlassen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">koenne</unclear>. Derhalben so
<lb n="31"/>habent wir uff söllich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">end</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hin</unclear> und uß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürßorg</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>lenger nit verziechen koennen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuosamen</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kunfft</unclear> von uns den vier <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-771" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Evangelischen Stetten</orgName>, sambt
<lb n="34"/>dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Roden</unclear> deß landts <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Appenzell</placeName> und üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebeschryben</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2513_9690.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namblich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guot</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">über</unclear> acht tag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">3</unclear> te nechst
<lb n="36"/>ingehenden monats novembris abents <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> unser statt
<lb n="37"/>alhie an der <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrberg</unclear></placeName> zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschynen</unclear>, wellichen tag wir üch
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkuendend</unclear>, und üch darby frünt- eydtgnössisch
